OL,3,GNEWSAFunding of #5.5m to help rough
OL,4,Asleepers off streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #5m is to be spent helping
OL,7,Fpeople sleeping rough in the West
OL,8,FMidlands to get accommodation and
OL,9,Fsupport over Christmas and the winter
OL,10,Fmonths.
OL,12,FThe Government has awarded #5.5m which
OL,13,Fwill be distributed among councils in
OL,14,Fthe region.
OL,16,FHelp with health issues is among the
OL,17,Fpractical assistance set to be
OL,18,Fdelivered for those who seek it.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
