OL,3,GNEWSAFunding of #5.5m to help rough
OL,4,Asleepers off streets
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham will receive #2.6 million
OL,7,Fwhile Coventry will be awarded
OL,8,F#815,000, Dudley #317,000, Sandwell
OL,9,F#533,000, Solihull #360,000, Walsall
OL,10,F#394,000 and Wolverhampton #505,000.
